e,\n      \"audioFile\": \"audio/pn-maths-03.mp3\",\n      \"imageCard\": \"images/pn-maths-03.png\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"activityId\": \"pn-maths-04\",\n      \"ageRange\": \"2–3\",\n      \"topicEn\": \"Inside / outside\",\n      \"topicHa\": \"Ciki da waje\",\n      \"topicAjami\": \"ﭼِﻛِﻰ دَ وَجٜ\",\n      \"ajami_validated\": false,\n      \"audioFile\": \"audio/pn-maths-04.mp3\",\n      \"imageCard\": \"images/pn-maths-04.png\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"activityId\": \"pn-maths-05\",\n      \"ageRange\": \"2–3\",\n      \"topicEn\": \"Counting 1–5 with fingers\",\n      \"topicHa\": \"Kirgawa 1–5 da yatsu\",\n      \"topicAjami\": \"ﻛِرﻏَوَ ١–٥ دَ ﯾَﺗُسُ\",\n      \"ajami_validated\": false,\n      \"audioFile\": \"audio/pn-maths-05.mp3\",\n      \"imageCard\": \"images/pn-maths-05.png\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"activityId\": \"pn-maths-06\",\n      \"ageRange\": \"2–3\",\n      \"topicEn\": \"Matching two same shapes\",\n      \"topicHa\": \"Daidaita siffofi guda biyu\",\n      \"topicAjami\": \"دَﯾْدَﯾْتَ ﺳِﻔُوﻓِﻰ ﻏُدَ ﺑِﯾُو\",\n      \"ajami_validated\": false,\n      \"audioFile\": \"audio/pn-maths-06.mp3\",\n      \"imageCard\": \"images/pn-maths-06.png\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"modules\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"n1-maths-01\",\n      \"gradeband\": \"nursery1\",\n      \"subject\": \"Mathematics\",\n      \"subjectHa\": \"Lissafi\",\n      \"moduleNumber\": 1,\n      \"titleEn\": \"Counting 1–5\",\n      \"titleHa\": \"Kirgawa 1–5\",\n      \"titleAjami\": \"ﻛِرﻏَوَ ١–٥\",\n      \"ajami_validated\": false,\n      \"textExplanationHa\": \"Kirgawa yana nufin faɗin lambobi a jere. A wannan darasi, za mu koyi kirgawa daga ɗaya zuwa biyar. Fara da lamba ɗaya. Ka ce 'ɗaya'. Sai ka ce 'biyu'. Sai 'uku'. Sai 'huɗu'. Sai 'biyar'. Ka yi amfani da yatsun hannunka. Nuna yatsa ɗaya don 'ɗaya', yatsu biyu don 'biyu', haka zuwa biyar. Ka kuma kirga abubuwa a gida, kamar kujeru ko faranti. Alal misali, idan kana da kujeru uku, ka ce 'ɗaya, biyu, uku'. Maimaita sau da yawa.