 siblingAjami: false,\n    s: 'Kirgawa yana nufin faɗin lambobi a jere. A wannan darasi, za mu koyi kirgawa daga ɗaya zuwa biyar. Fara da lamba ɗaya. K'\n  },\n  {\n    path: 'modules.1.segments.1.text.ha',\n    ap: 2,\n    siblingAjami: false,\n    s: \"Biyar – kamar 'S' mai tudun kai. \"\n  },\n  {\n    path: 'modules.2.segments.0.text.ha',\n    ap: 2,\n    siblingAjami: false,\n    s: \"A wannan darasi, za mu koyi siffofi biyu: zobe da murabba'i. Zobe yana da zagaye, kamar ƙwallo ko faranti. Babu gefe a z\"\n  },\n  {\n    path: 'modules.2.segments.1.text.ha',\n    ap: 1,\n    siblingAjami: false,\n    s: \"Murabba'i: siffa mai gefe huɗu. Ka nuna zobe a gida, misali faranti. \"\n  },\n  {\n    path: 'modules.2.segments.2.text.ha',\n    ap: 1,\n    siblingAjami: false,\n    s: \"Ka nuna murabba'i, misali akwati.\"\n  },\n  {\n    path: 'modules.3.segments.2.text.ha',\n    ap: 4,\n    siblingAjami: false,\n    s: \"Ka ce 'babba' don abu mai girma, 'ƙarami' don abu mai ƙarami.\"\n  },\n  {\n    path: 'modules.4.segments.0.text.ha',\n    ap: 8,\n    siblingAjami: false,\n    s: \"Yanzu za mu koyi kirgawa daga shida zuwa goma. Bayan biyar, sai shida. Ka ce 'shida'. Sai bakwai: 'bakwai'. Sai takwas: \"\n  },\n  {\n    path: 'modules.4.segments.1.text.ha',\n    ap: 2,\n    siblingAjami: false,\n    s: \"Sai goma: 'goma'. Ka yi amfani da yatsu biyu hannunka don 6-10. \"\n  },\n  {\n    path: 'modules.5.segments.0.text.ha',\n    ap: 3,\n    siblingAjami: false,\n    s: \"Yau za mu rubuta lambobi daga shida zuwa goma. Ka riga ka san rubuta 1-5. Yanzu shida: kamar 'b' da lanƙwasa. Bakwai: ka\"\n  },\n  {\n    path: 'modules.5.segments.1.text.ha',\n    ap: 1,\n    siblingAjami: false,\n    s: \"Goma: sanda da da'ira (1 da 0). \"\n  },\n  {\n    path: 'modules.7.segments.0.text.ha',\n    ap: 1,\n    siblingAjami: false,\n    s: 'A wannan darasi, zamu kwatanta tsayi: doguwa da gajere. Doguwa – abu mai tsayi kamar sanda. Gajere – abu mai ɗan tsayi k'\n  },\n  {\n    path: 'modules.8.segments.0.text.ha',\n    ap: 2,\n    siblingAjami: false,\n    s: \"Yawa yana nufin abubuwa da yawa. Kaɗan yana nufin abubuwa kaɗan. Ka kalli kwano ɗaya yana da 'ya'yan goro biyar – wannan\"\n  },\n  {\n    path: 'modules.10.segments.0.text.ha',\n    ap: 6,\n    siblingAjami: false,\n    s: 'Tsari yana nufin yadda abubuwa suke biyo bayan juna. Tsarin ABAB yana nufin abu A, sai B, sai A, sai B. Misali: ja, shuɗ'\n  },\n  {\n    path: 'modules.11.segments.0.text.ha',\n    ap: 1,\n    siblingAjami: false,\n    s: \"Wannan darasi na maimaita duk abin da muka koya: kirgawa 1-10, rubuta, siffofi (zobe, murabba'i, alwatika, madaidaici), \"\n  },\n  {\n    path: 'modules.17.segments.0.text.ha',\n    ap: 2,\n    siblingAjami: false,\n    s: \"Ƙari yana nufin haɗa abubuwa wuri ɗaya. Alal misali, kana da 'ya'yan goro 2, ka ƙara 3, yanzu kana da 5. Ka ce 2+3=5. \"\n  }\n]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
